{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sol Mates</strong> is a roguelike co-op adventure for up to 4 players to play locally or online. Team up, blast through space hazards, and tackle ever-changing missions. One wrong move could land you face-to-face with a giant alien crab!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With Great Chaos, Comes Great Responsibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between loading guns, steering your ship, operating your shields, charging batteries, putting out fires and more, everyone\u2019s gonna have to pull their own weight for your ship to stay in one piece and to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/232578913abf8935dc0ce0dc055fd660.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/232578913abf8935dc0ce0dc055fd660.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decisions Decisions Decisions\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote on decisions big and small; you'll determine how the story unfolds. A wrecked ship lies in a volatile minefield. Do you risk it for the biscuit? If it all goes sideways, try a new path on your next run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/0ef50c0479d5da2eaaf6a68b33639d7c.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/0ef50c0479d5da2eaaf6a68b33639d7c.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Up The Heat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you and your mates got what it takes to take on greater challenges? Swing by the Space Bar to dial up the difficulty and test your crew\u2019s skills. Add tougher enemies, wilder hazards, and unpredictable twists for a challenge worthy of the galaxy\u2019s bravest (or most reckless) pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/a75f0a03a8cf0d54d424084f8aa9d1fa.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/a75f0a03a8cf0d54d424084f8aa9d1fa.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up Your Loadout (and Your Look)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more you unlock! New weapons, ammo types, ships, and cosmetics galore. Upgrade your gear and deck yourself out in stylish hats that won\u2019t improve your skills\u2026 but will absolutely make you <i>look</i> like they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/7461a915418271866f084970e4ecf75a.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/7461a915418271866f084970e4ecf75a.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The <i>Sol Mates</i> Origin Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-Op is the genre of our childhoods! Well - for those of you who grew up in the 90's\u00a0 We wanted to make a game for you to invite your friends to come over and navigate the perils of space together. \u201cShields are down!\u201d \u201cGet to the guns!\u201d we want players to live out those epic sci-fi movie moments we grew up with but together on the couch\u2026or online!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/b34a97bb9ec6dc9c8f87b4ae3c6fcbf8.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/b34a97bb9ec6dc9c8f87b4ae3c6fcbf8.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize: Pick your color! Pick your hat! Pick your species(!?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade: Shop on your journey; bigger shields, freezing ammo, tractor beams, oh my!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote: For decisions big and small, consult your crewmates and choose your adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice: For veteran Sol Mates, juice up the challenge with additional difficulty to unlock more swag!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420800?t=1770678574","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770678574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/81d64c17edde8d2e4a1b7411813794566672cef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770678574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/81d64c17edde8d2e4a1b7411813794566672cef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770678574","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3763450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sol Mates</strong> is a roguelike co-op adventure for up to 4 players to play locally or online. Team up, blast through space hazards, and tackle ever-changing missions. One wrong move could land you face-to-face with a giant alien crab!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With Great Chaos, Comes Great Responsibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between loading guns, steering your ship, operating your shields, charging batteries, putting out fires and more, everyone\u2019s gonna have to pull their own weight for your ship to stay in one piece and to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/232578913abf8935dc0ce0dc055fd660.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/232578913abf8935dc0ce0dc055fd660.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decisions Decisions Decisions\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote on decisions big and small; you'll determine how the story unfolds. A wrecked ship lies in a volatile minefield. Do you risk it for the biscuit? If it all goes sideways, try a new path on your next run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/0ef50c0479d5da2eaaf6a68b33639d7c.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/0ef50c0479d5da2eaaf6a68b33639d7c.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Up The Heat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you and your mates got what it takes to take on greater challenges? Swing by the Space Bar to dial up the difficulty and test your crew\u2019s skills. Add tougher enemies, wilder hazards, and unpredictable twists for a challenge worthy of the galaxy\u2019s bravest (or most reckless) pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/a75f0a03a8cf0d54d424084f8aa9d1fa.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/a75f0a03a8cf0d54d424084f8aa9d1fa.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up Your Loadout (and Your Look)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more you unlock! New weapons, ammo types, ships, and cosmetics galore. Upgrade your gear and deck yourself out in stylish hats that won\u2019t improve your skills\u2026 but will absolutely make you <i>look</i> like they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/7461a915418271866f084970e4ecf75a.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/7461a915418271866f084970e4ecf75a.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The <i>Sol Mates</i> Origin Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-Op is the genre of our childhoods! Well - for those of you who grew up in the 90's\u00a0 We wanted to make a game for you to invite your friends to come over and navigate the perils of space together. \u201cShields are down!\u201d \u201cGet to the guns!\u201d we want players to live out those epic sci-fi movie moments we grew up with but together on the couch\u2026or online!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/b34a97bb9ec6dc9c8f87b4ae3c6fcbf8.poster.avif?t=1770678574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/extras/b34a97bb9ec6dc9c8f87b4ae3c6fcbf8.webm?t=1770678574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize: Pick your color! Pick your hat! Pick your species(!?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade: Shop on your journey; bigger shields, freezing ammo, tractor beams, oh my!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote: For decisions big and small, consult your crewmates and choose your adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juice: For veteran Sol Mates, juice up the challenge with additional difficulty to unlock more swag!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Daruma Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/header.jpg?t=1770678574","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Daruma Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requi