aruma Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSol Mates brings its own spacefaring flavor to the Overcooked formula.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThis release from Daruma Games supports local and online co-op for up to four players, who are tasked with surviving in the great expanse of space by doing \u201codd jobs through the galaxy.\u201d It\u2019s also pretty darn cute.\u201d<br>The Verge<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/ss_f7887599b1b2b88ab3cdaa66cded5cad43b7ba98.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770678574","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/ss_f7887599b1b2b88ab3cdaa66cded5cad43b7ba98.600x338.jpg?t=1770678574"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/ss_f8ad5ce6653d913b72a7af62cd8a89e084ee1f7e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770678574","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/ss_f8ad5ce6653d913b72a7af62cd8a89e084ee1f7e.600x338.jpg?t=1770678574"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/a3f2a204919512aeaa53d7623a6d547294a30219/ss_a3f2a204919512aeaa53d7623a6d547294a30219.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770678574","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/a3f2a204919512aeaa53d7623a6d547294a30219/ss_a3f2a204919512aeaa53d7623a6d547294a30219.600x338.jpg?t=1770678574"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420800/b0a191bfaf7ac6c634f69aa9cc0ea3dc5635a446/ss_b0a191bfaf7ac6c634f69aa9cc0ea3